Set the execution path for all commands.

 path "/bin", "/sbin", "/usr/bin", "/usr/sbin", "/usr/pkg/bin", "/usr/pkg/sbin";

It's a convenience wrapper for the L<set_path|Rex::Config#set_path> configuration option.

=cut
