Set the public key.

=cut
=head2 private_key($key)

Set the private key.

=cut
=head2 pass_auth

If you want to use password authentication, then you need to call I<pass_auth>.

 user "root";
 password "root";

 pass_auth;

=cut
=head2 key_auth

If you want to use pubkey authentication, then you need to call I<key_auth>.

